# Publish the complete authoritative Pareto receipts and compact frozen inputs.
# Other historical/development output trees stay local.  The physical Q-field
# bank is deterministically regenerable and exceeds GitHub's 100 MB blob limit.
outputs/*
!outputs/pareto_robust/
outputs/pareto_robust/.matplotlib/
outputs/pareto_robust/frozen_inputs/physical_bank.npz
__pycache__/
!README.md
